--- reference_ingestion schema ---
                                                                    Table "public.reference_ingestion"
     Column     |           Type           | Collation | Nullable |                     Default                     | Storage  | Compression | Stats target | Description 
----------------+--------------------------+-----------+----------+-------------------------------------------------+----------+-------------+--------------+-------------
 id             | bigint                   |           | not null | nextval('reference_ingestion_id_seq'::regclass) | plain    |             |              | 
 product        | text                     |           | not null |                                                 | extended |             |              | 
 version        | text                     |           | not null |                                                 | extended |             |              | 
 scope          | text                     |           | not null | 'general'::text                                 | extended |             |              | 
 source_url     | text                     |           | not null |                                                 | extended |             |              | 
 chunk_count    | integer                  |           | not null | 0                                               | plain    |             |              | 
 upserted_count | integer                  |           | not null | 0                                               | plain    |             |              | 
 ingested_at    | timestamp with time zone |           | not null | now()                                           | plain    |             |              | 
Indexes:
    "reference_ingestion_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (id)
    "ref_ingestion_product_version_idx" btree (product, version, ingested_at DESC)
Access method: heap


